We kindly ask you indicate your name and organization initials in square brackets before your comment, and to separate each comment by three dashes (e.g. `[FL-NMI] comment 1. --- [CP-BIPM] comment 2. --- [FL-NMI] comment 3.`). Please note that the units presented in the column `si_unit` is the default unit expression for the quantity, but other unit expressions that are dimensionally equivalent will be accepted in the CMCs (e.g. a quantity set to radians per second, will also accept degrees per hour, and dimentionless quantities will accept percent values).
